---
title: "Baton — UML State Diagram: Pipeline Event Lifecycle"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> received : Webhook arrives

    received --> processing : WebhookWorker picks up
    processing --> pending : Rule matched &amp; conditions pass<br/>(rule_match entry created)
    processing --> queued : Rule matched but paused<br/>(stored in queued-webhooks)
    processing --> no_match : No matching rules<br/>(inbound entry only)
    processing --> failed : Extraction or matching error

    queued --> pending : Rule resumed —<br/>queued webhook released

    pending --> launching : LauncherWorker picks up
    launching --> skipped : Usage/relay gate denies<br/>(no retry)
    launching --> completed : Workflow Builder instance triggered
    launching --> retrying : Workflow Builder API error<br/>(transient, attempts 1-6)
    retrying --> launching : Retry after backoff<br/>(2s / 4s / 8s / 5m / 15m / 30m)
    retrying --> failed : Max 6 retries exceeded

    no_match --> [*] : Pipeline ends<br/>(logged, no action)
    skipped --> [*] : Pipeline ends<br/>(usage-limit message shown)
    completed --> [*] : Instance tracked as "running"<br/>(30s sync → completed/failed<br/>+ notification)
    failed --> [*] : Pipeline ends<br/>(failure notification sent)

    state received {
        [*] --> signature_verify
        signature_verify --> store_raw : Valid signature<br/>(HMAC / basic auth / API key)
        signature_verify --> rejected : Invalid signature (401)
        store_raw --> respond_200
        respond_200 --> enqueue_sqs
        rejected --> [*]
    }

    state processing {
        [*] --> extract_event
        extract_event --> find_rules
        find_rules --> evaluate_conditions
        evaluate_conditions --> map_fields : Conditions pass
    }

    state launching {
        [*] --> resolve_connection
        resolve_connection --> decrypt_tokens
        decrypt_tokens --> call_workflow_builder
        call_workflow_builder --> track_instance
    }
